  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fessential.gg%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mlIeMaM.jpeg\" alt=\"Essentials 合作夥伴橫幅\"></a></p><h1>更多方塊 · <img height=\"22\" width=\"79.53846153846154\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/O6kUNhI.png\"></h1><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/seface-studios/some-more-blocks?logo=github&amp;logoColor=959da5&amp;labelColor=353c43&amp;color=0091c2&amp;Current&amp;label=最新版本\" alt=\"最新版本\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/some-more-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge 上可用-測試版?logo=CurseForge&amp;logoColor=fff&amp;color=EB622B&amp;link=https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/some-more-blocks\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsome-more-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth 上可用-下載?logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=fff&amp;color=02b63a&amp;link=https://modrinth.com/mod/some-more-blocks\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a></p><p><strong>更多方塊</strong>是一款原版風格擴展模組，為遊戲新增多種方塊變體。\n本模組新增超過 500 種新方塊，例如磚塊、瓷磚、苔蘚方塊、木質鑲嵌等，大幅擴展您的建築可能性。</p><span><span><iframe width=\"850\" height=\"472\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1ddBxB1OmlI?si=y-sKwgMfKyOPXRbo\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S4Npy2B.png\" alt=\"安裝指南\"></p><ol>\n<li>下載並安裝您偏好的模組載入器<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fneoforged.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></li></ul></li>\n<li>透過官方連結下載模組並放入模組資料夾<ul>\n<li>CurseForge（您目前所在位置！）</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsome-more-blocks%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li></ul></li>\n</ol><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8CUDmM1.png\" alt=\"成為翻譯者\"></p><p>想幫助將此模組推廣給更多玩家嗎？您完全可以做到！</p><p>無論您精通其他語言，或只是想幫忙潤飾幾行文字，每一份貢獻都彌足珍貴。我們將為所有貢獻者署名致謝——您的名字將會被列出，感謝您讓模組更易於接觸！</p><p>準備好協助了嗎？請加入我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fminecraft-some-more-blocks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a> 專案。</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xbumFgJ.png\" alt=\"回報問題\"></p><p>發現任何異常或錯誤嗎？漏洞難免發生，而您的協助能讓這個專案變得更好。您可以<a href=\"https://github.com/Seface-Studios/some-more-blocks/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在此提交問題</a>，若已有解決方案，更歡迎直接發送拉取請求。我們衷心感謝任何形式的幫助！</p><hr><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CMJ3EZ9.png\" alt=\"永誌緬懷\"></p><hr><table style=\"width:100%\">\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td style=\"text-align:left\">\n        <h3>Seface Studios</h3>\n        <p>\n          <a href=\"mailto:contact@sefacestudios.net\" rel=\"nofollow\">contact@sefacestudios.net</a> · \n          <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=%252flinkout%253fremoteUrl%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fSefaceStudios\" rel=\"nofollow\">𝕏（原 Twitter）</a> · \n          <a href=\"https://discord.gg/c8fvBPrAqD\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n      <td style=\"text-align:right;width:64px\">\n        <img height=\"64\" width=\"64\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/45r1STW.gif\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>",
